nodecode-requesty is a rewrite of requestyai's requestyai/hermes-provider-requesty:
https://github.com/requestyai/hermes-provider-requesty
commit aa4e37d7f09dfc1e98b915d740d09e8b1b44c98d
MIT, Copyright (c) 2026 Requesty (LICENSE)

Rewritten for Nodecode: the provider profile (id, display name, base URL,
key variable, signup page, fallback model list), its reasoning rules (only to
a catalog-marked reasoning model, Requesty's own spelling, off sent as
"none"), its trace id, and its model picker's source, GET /v1/models/managed
-- which here is the /requesty command, read on demand and put into /models
rather than fetched at load. Left out: the original's in-process cache with
its background warm-up and its per-request price estimates in the Hermes
dashboard's shape, because Nodecode's catalog carries the context windows and
prices its own surfaces read, and the live managed catalog supplies those two
fields where Requesty publishes them; and the original's own User-Agent,
since every Nodecode request names Nodecode.
